# The repository stores LF, and Prettier checks for LF. Without this, core.autocrlf
# checks the tree out as CRLF and `npm run lint` fails on 91 files whose only fault
# is their line endings — which is how that script stopped being a useful signal.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
